From c8ceb55dc9bcebe384971f42276420208078c2e7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:05:29 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(drilling): preserve opposite blind hole depths and mouths

Merge coaxial walls only when their axial spans touch or overlap.
Use floor evidence to keep each blind hole's entry direction.
Report directed findings on mills and retain generation refusals.
Pin closed opposite holes and a six-hole D50 bar.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2601
